        "title": "Maybe, a poem?",
        "date": "February 20, 2026",
        "body": "---\n\nFor as far as you wish    \nFor as long as you stretch    \nIn the moment you lumber    \nIn haste, toward the mountain    \n    \nThe general truth    \nThe uncourteous example    \nNever minding the canopy    \nStretching, aching with heaviness  \n  \nReminder, your cohort  \nBelieves in the coddling fervor  \nThe mind-numbing ache  \nThe key-turn freeing  \n  \nWhat's the angle, then?  \nTo a friend, just perspiration  \nTo our valley below, it's normality  \nDo you remember the promise?  \n  \nSo take wing to the summit  \nThree paths, picked not yet  \nWe may celebrate not the gift  \nAnd yet, burn pleasant all the same",
        "file": "2026-02-20-maybe--a-poem-.md"
